Package: keyboardforge-linux
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: gatchez
Description: KeyboardForge -- Linux keyboard layout installer.
 Modular, cross-platform (Debian, Fedora, Arch) installer for KeyboardForge
 keyboard layouts, with automatic Desktop Environment configuration
 (GNOME, KDE Plasma, XFCE) and Wayland/X11 detection.
Depends: xkb-data, libxml2-utils
